-- The live overlay is consulted only by ^name: ^focus reads the sidecar mask while bare focus keeps naming its column, so the two counts agree at 2 and their conjunction is empty in one and the same world.
-- The first statement elides its subject with no antecedent, which is the ruled ^cursor cold default: the overlay's cursor mask marks row 4, not the bare cursor column's row 2. ^watch has no overlay entry, so it falls back to the bare name — the static alias-mask fixture, which never moves.
--! registry ../registries/005-alias-overlay.reg
--! expect marked = 0 0 0 0 1
--! expect health = 50 0 1 0 90
--! expect gold = 15 99 30 40 55

+Marked
^focus , Health = 0
focus , Gold += 5
!^focus & !focus , Health = 1
^watch , Gold = 99

--! out 2
#/ ^focus

--! out 2
#/ focus

--! out 0
#/ (^focus & focus)
